WEBVTT

00:23.410 --> 00:30.380
It's right before your eyes... Just a little more...

00:30.630 --> 00:35.470
Your dream is right there.

00:36.180 --> 00:41.390
Only a small hunch...

00:41.640 --> 00:45.480
...keeps your hopes up now.

00:45.730 --> 00:50.860
In this endless, dark maze,

00:50.980 --> 00:54.990
strength is realizing...

00:55.740 --> 00:57.780
...your own weakness.

00:57.780 --> 01:01.120
Taking in the shining wind,

01:01.120 --> 01:06.120
you can fly...

01:06.620 --> 01:08.880
...towards the vast sky.

01:11.920 --> 01:15.970
When even the deepest darkness turns into light...

01:16.050 --> 01:23.560
...I believe in that instant.

01:24.230 --> 01:27.810
I'll keep on believing...

02:20.240 --> 02:21.990
<i>Tell me, Chiaki.</i>

02:23.870 --> 02:27.500
<i>When you said "Let's be together," was that a lie?</i>

02:27.500 --> 02:30.880
<i>Did you approach me because you knew I was Jeanne?!</i>

02:36.260 --> 02:37.340
<i>It's true...</i>

02:38.300 --> 02:41.970
<i>I approached you because I knew you were Jeanne.</i>

02:44.930 --> 02:51.310
<i>I thought the best way to stop you being a Kaitou was to make you fall in love with me.</i>

02:51.310 --> 02:52.560
<i>However...</i>

02:52.560 --> 02:54.440
<i>Listen to me, Maron!</i>

02:54.440 --> 02:56.190
<i>At first, that was how I felt.</i>

02:57.110 --> 03:00.910
<i>I couldn't believe in love and affection!</i>

03:01.740 --> 03:03.780
<i>But now it's different!</i>

03:03.780 --> 03:07.660
Stop! That's enough! I don't want to hear it!

03:07.660 --> 03:11.170
<i>Don't hurt me anymore!</i>

03:11.170 --> 03:12.670
<i> I've had enough!</i>

03:13.880 --> 03:19.510
I...I'm not going to trust anyone!

03:19.510 --> 03:22.590
I'm not going to trust anyone!

03:23.180 --> 03:27.060
<i>Jeanne, be confused! Suffer!</i>

03:28.180 --> 03:32.770
<i>As you sink into grief and become more and more exhausted...</i>

03:32.770 --> 03:38.820
<i>You will become weaker, physically and emotionally, and the barrier of God will become thinner and thinner.</i>

03:56.750 --> 03:59.630
<i>There's no one...I can trust!</i>

04:05.600 --> 04:09.350
<i>Jeannne's power is rapdily evaporating...</i>

04:22.740 --> 04:27.240
Jeanne: Revival of the Power of Love!

04:39.840 --> 04:41.050
Maron!

04:48.680 --> 04:51.390
What are you daydreaming about?!

04:51.390 --> 04:53.480
Are you planning to skip gymnastics practice?!

04:53.480 --> 04:55.520
You startled me!

04:57.730 --> 04:58.980
What is it?

05:00.480 --> 05:06.200
You seem really depressed lately, and you haven't talked to Chiaki at all, either.

05:06.200 --> 05:08.530
What in the world happened?

05:08.530 --> 05:11.120
Chiaki is a liar...

05:11.120 --> 05:13.500
I don't want to talk to him...

05:13.500 --> 05:16.370
Lie? What kind of lie did he tell?

05:17.710 --> 05:20.800
Hey, what kind of lie did Chiaki tell?

05:23.210 --> 05:26.550
Hmm... It's something you can't even tell me...

05:27.680 --> 05:30.970
Keeping people at an arm's length... You're always like that.

05:30.970 --> 05:32.600
You were like that then, too!

05:33.390 --> 05:35.060
Then?

05:35.060 --> 05:39.270
When you were just beginning to like Chiaki.

05:39.270 --> 05:41.320
Or have you forgotten?

05:43.360 --> 05:46.530
Back then, I was head over heels in love with Chiaki...

05:46.530 --> 05:52.160
So in order not to hurt me, you denied liking Chiaki...

05:52.160 --> 05:54.200
...and suffered by yourself.

05:54.200 --> 05:56.710
You were hiding your true feelings from me!

05:56.710 --> 05:59.630
Although, back then I was grateful for that.

05:59.630 --> 06:02.800
That you were looking out for me...

06:01.750 --> 06:02.800
Maron, hurry up!

06:02.800 --> 06:05.840
You go on ahead.

06:04.340 --> 06:11.010
Aren't there times when people lie and hide the truth so that they don't end up hurting somebody?

06:11.010 --> 06:13.100
Huh?

06:14.430 --> 06:16.520
Geez! You idiot!

06:16.520 --> 06:21.150
It means that people sometimes lie to avoid hurting others!

06:21.150 --> 06:25.150
I don't know what happened, but you have to trust Chiaki.

06:29.360 --> 06:31.370
What are you doing wasting time here?!

06:31.370 --> 06:34.490
Kanako is here to coach for us!

06:35.160 --> 06:36.330
Kanako-senpai?!

06:42.960 --> 06:45.090
Rotate your arm wider!

06:52.720 --> 06:53.930
What's the matter?

06:55.220 --> 06:57.600
You're not your normal, lively self!

06:57.600 --> 06:58.850
It's nothing...

06:58.850 --> 07:03.650
I heard from Miyako that you're having problems with your boyfriend.

07:03.650 --> 07:05.190
That Miyako...

07:05.190 --> 07:07.490
Maron-chan, do you remember?

07:07.490 --> 07:08.190
Huh?

07:08.650 --> 07:12.160
Right before the wedding, my fiancé...

07:13.990 --> 07:15.990
<i>The wedding is off!!!</i>

07:21.250 --> 07:24.420
But Pakkyamlamao-sensei said...

07:25.710 --> 07:28.380
"Trust Junji-san and wait for him."

07:29.880 --> 07:33.550
And I'm really glad I did.

07:33.550 --> 07:34.550
You see...

07:36.470 --> 07:39.310
What?! Congratulations!

07:39.310 --> 07:40.230
Thank you.

07:44.770 --> 07:47.320
Don't make Jeanne feel better!!!

07:47.320 --> 07:48.820
She's in the way...

07:53.360 --> 07:55.370
Thank you very much for today!

07:55.370 --> 07:56.080
It's okay.

07:56.080 --> 07:58.330
Wow! That brooch is beautiful!

08:00.000 --> 08:02.870
I bought it in Paris on our honeymoon.

08:03.870 --> 08:05.290
How nice...

08:05.290 --> 08:06.290
Well, see you later.

08:06.290 --> 08:07.630
Goodbye!

08:09.630 --> 08:12.510
Geez, they're so perfect...

08:15.720 --> 08:19.180
Hey, Maron! Could you come to the fountain park later on?

08:19.180 --> 08:20.850
Sure, but what's going on?

08:20.850 --> 08:22.350
Oh, something.

08:22.350 --> 08:24.520
If you have something to say, just spit it out...

08:24.520 --> 08:26.150
You'd better be there!

08:33.150 --> 08:35.570
It's true!

08:37.580 --> 08:39.330
What a beautiful candy box.

08:43.910 --> 08:45.170
Thank you.

08:58.550 --> 09:02.180
Miyako, if you have something to say, you had better come quick!

09:07.310 --> 09:09.190
You have something to say to me?

09:09.190 --> 09:10.480
No, I don't.

09:10.480 --> 09:12.230
Huh? That's odd.

09:12.230 --> 09:14.030
Miyako said...

09:17.780 --> 09:19.950
Oh, I get it. So that's what it was.

09:20.950 --> 09:25.160
Miyako went through the trouble of setting us up. Why don't we talk a little?

09:25.160 --> 09:28.170
I don't want to hear what you have to say.

09:28.170 --> 09:31.460
Maron, I'm always on your side.

09:31.460 --> 09:32.920
What are you talking about?!

09:32.920 --> 09:34.880
You're siding with the Devil!

09:34.880 --> 09:36.260
That's a misunderstanding!

09:37.010 --> 09:40.180
I don't think you'd believe me if I told you everything right now.

09:40.180 --> 09:42.180
But I want you to believe this:

09:42.180 --> 09:45.180
You approached me because you knew all about me!

09:45.890 --> 09:48.230
So you could manipulate me...

09:49.150 --> 09:51.150
At first, that was true...

09:51.980 --> 09:53.440
But it's different now!

09:55.360 --> 09:58.860
Now the only thing I can think about is you!

09:58.860 --> 10:00.990
Stop saying that!

10:00.990 --> 10:03.990
You're Sinbad, the servant of the Devil!

10:03.990 --> 10:05.200
Maron...!

10:08.290 --> 10:11.090
I wonder what's going on?

10:11.090 --> 10:15.300
It seems like Chiaki told a lie that hurt Maron...

10:15.300 --> 10:18.550
What? I wonder what's going to happen between those two?!

10:18.550 --> 10:21.550
Hey! What's that happy face for?!

10:21.550 --> 10:25.600
Do you want those two to break up?!

10:25.600 --> 10:29.650
No! I mean... It's not that...

10:29.650 --> 10:31.560
I have to do something for them...

10:31.560 --> 10:34.020
Geez, just take it out on me...

10:38.490 --> 10:42.240
<i>Now the only thing I can think about is you!</i>

10:42.240 --> 10:47.250
<i>Sinbad is my enemy, but I... Chiaki...</i>

10:50.460 --> 10:52.170
Kusakabe!

10:52.170 --> 10:54.040
Have you seen Kanako?!

10:54.040 --> 10:55.670
Has something happened?

10:55.670 --> 11:01.140
After we said goodbye, Kanako started acting strangely...

11:01.470 --> 11:02.680
<i>I hate you!</i>

11:02.680 --> 11:03.850
HATE YOU!

11:07.980 --> 11:10.190
I don't understand Kanako's feelings...!

11:10.190 --> 11:12.400
What are you saying?!

11:12.400 --> 11:14.820
Anyway, the first thing we need to do is find her!

11:14.820 --> 11:15.610
Yes!

11:15.610 --> 11:17.570
We'll split up!

11:51.350 --> 11:52.690
<i>Kanako-senpai...!</i>

12:00.070 --> 12:02.030
<i>A Demon has possessed her...!</i>

12:11.000 --> 12:12.330
Kanako-senpai...

12:30.980 --> 12:34.690
<i>Another person close to me is being possessed by a Demon...!</i>

12:34.690 --> 12:35.850
<i>Fin!</i>

12:36.610 --> 12:39.270
<i>How long is this battle going to continue?!</i>

12:39.270 --> 12:40.730
<i>When will it end?!</i>

13:04.680 --> 13:07.510
<i>Notice to Yamagiwa Kanako-sama...</i>

13:07.510 --> 13:11.970
Tonight, I will be taking your beautiful brooch. - Kaitou Jeanne

13:14.640 --> 13:16.900
Kanako! You're home!

13:17.900 --> 13:18.900
Kanako!

13:29.070 --> 13:31.740
<i>Fin, is this what I'm supposed to do?</i>

13:31.740 --> 13:33.000
What?!

13:33.000 --> 13:34.830
A notice from Jeanne?!

13:34.830 --> 13:37.170
It was sent to my wife.

13:37.170 --> 13:39.170
This time she wants a brooch.

13:39.170 --> 13:42.000
Why does she want to steal something like that?

13:42.000 --> 13:45.880
It just means that women are attracted by beautiful things.

13:45.880 --> 13:47.340
Another whim of hers.

13:47.340 --> 13:49.390
So where is your wife right now?

13:49.390 --> 13:52.470
W-Well, she just left and I haven't had contact since.

13:52.470 --> 13:53.470
That's dangerous.

13:53.470 --> 13:55.390
Find her immediately! We must protect her!

14:02.730 --> 14:04.740
Jeanne will definitely come.

14:04.740 --> 14:06.650
When she does, kill her.

14:09.070 --> 14:11.330
We found someone matching Yamagiwa Kanako's description.

14:11.330 --> 14:14.120
She's at the building under construction on Lakiteru Street.

14:23.340 --> 14:24.000
Kanako!

14:24.000 --> 14:24.840
Hold on!

14:24.840 --> 14:26.380
Let me go!

14:26.380 --> 14:27.970
Calm down!

14:27.970 --> 14:31.010
Why is Kanako-senpai at a place like this?

14:31.010 --> 14:33.890
Jeanne is after her brooch...

14:33.890 --> 14:34.930
Well...

14:35.770 --> 14:39.600
Don't worry, we will protect your wife.

14:53.370 --> 14:54.490
Kanako-senpai!

14:55.290 --> 14:57.830
<i>I'm going to have a baby.</i>

15:01.380 --> 15:03.210
<i>I won't forgive the Demon!</i>

15:08.420 --> 15:10.260
<i>Fin, lend me you power!</i>

15:10.260 --> 15:12.680
<i>Deliver my wish to Jeanne d'Arc!</i>

15:34.070 --> 15:36.240
<i>Strong and serious...</i>

15:36.240 --> 15:38.450
<i>Matchless and marvelous...</i>

15:38.450 --> 15:40.330
<i>Energetic and courageous!</i>

15:46.920 --> 15:50.670
<i>Kaitou Jeanne has arrived by the order of God!</i>

15:57.220 --> 15:58.850
Jeanne's on the go!

15:59.680 --> 16:00.850
All right, let's go!

16:00.850 --> 16:02.440
Like that?!

16:02.440 --> 16:03.230
Yeah.

16:03.230 --> 16:05.690
Why? It's dangerous!

16:05.690 --> 16:08.070
Right now, I want to help her as Nagoya Chiaki.

16:19.660 --> 16:22.000
Don't interfere!

16:44.020 --> 16:47.560
Jeanne, how do you like the breeze of these giant fans?

16:54.820 --> 16:56.450
Cut her off!

16:57.370 --> 16:59.740
I won't let you escape!

17:05.330 --> 17:06.460
What's the matter?!

17:06.460 --> 17:08.210
The elevator stopped!

17:08.210 --> 17:10.460
I-I know that!

17:10.460 --> 17:12.420
Break open the door!

17:35.950 --> 17:38.660
You've arrived, Jeanne. I've been waiting for you!

17:38.660 --> 17:40.530
Get away from her!

17:54.460 --> 17:58.550
You're going to die all alone!

17:58.550 --> 18:01.470
All alone... By myself...

18:03.310 --> 18:04.600
I'm not going to lose!

18:05.560 --> 18:07.440
Even if I'm all alone!

18:11.650 --> 18:12.980
In the name of God...

18:15.030 --> 18:17.490
You, a Demon, born in darkness...

18:19.780 --> 18:22.990
I seal you here!

18:33.000 --> 18:34.590
<i>Checkmate!</i>

18:41.470 --> 18:43.010
<i>Collection completed!</i>

18:52.940 --> 18:55.360
Jeanne, this is your grave!

18:56.320 --> 18:57.780
Who are you?!

18:57.780 --> 18:59.450
I'm Myst.

18:59.450 --> 19:01.530
I'm here to eliminate you.

19:01.530 --> 19:02.660
You're a Demon?

19:02.660 --> 19:03.740
Just die.

19:04.790 --> 19:06.120
Bye-bye!

19:12.880 --> 19:13.960
Die!

19:27.890 --> 19:29.810
My, my. What's the matter?

19:29.810 --> 19:34.190
Weren't you protected by the barrier of God?!

19:39.820 --> 19:41.240
This is boring.

19:41.240 --> 19:44.200
I thought you were much stronger.

19:44.200 --> 19:46.490
I want to play more.

19:46.490 --> 19:51.670
As long as you live, I can torture you by using the people around you.

19:52.670 --> 19:55.170
You've done all this just to lure me...?

19:55.170 --> 19:57.050
All the people I've met have become...

19:57.050 --> 19:59.550
Yea, but it's all over now!

20:04.180 --> 20:06.970
I wonder if the next attack will be the last?

20:06.970 --> 20:08.220
HAPPY...

20:09.220 --> 20:10.560
...END!!!

20:14.270 --> 20:15.480
Chiaki!

20:15.480 --> 20:17.190
I will protect Maron!

20:17.190 --> 20:19.530
I'll kill the both of you!

20:21.490 --> 20:24.030
What is this hideous light?!

20:35.750 --> 20:37.590
Maron, are you all right?

20:37.590 --> 20:38.550
Yes...

20:39.500 --> 20:42.010
Hurry up! The cops are coming!

20:43.880 --> 20:44.970
Kanako-senpai...

20:48.510 --> 20:51.350
She'll be fine. Now...

20:51.890 --> 20:53.440
Hurry! Hurry!

20:53.440 --> 20:55.900
It'll be trouble if they see you like that!

21:05.110 --> 21:08.030
Kanako-senpai, wake up!

21:11.040 --> 21:13.330
<i>The brooch was stolen...</i>

21:14.210 --> 21:15.290
Kanako!

21:16.080 --> 21:17.580
Kanako, are you okay?

21:18.670 --> 21:21.710
Jeanne beat us again...

21:21.710 --> 21:22.460
Y-Yeah...

21:23.090 --> 21:26.340
What have I been doing?

21:26.340 --> 21:28.970
I think I've said horrible things to you...

21:28.970 --> 21:30.220
No, you haven't.

21:30.220 --> 21:35.640
No, it felt like my heart was in such turmoil. It must have been because of the baby.

21:35.640 --> 21:37.690
B-Baby?!

21:40.360 --> 21:43.110
A baby?! That's wonderful!

21:43.110 --> 21:45.400
The moon is shining with happiness, too.

21:59.580 --> 22:03.880
<i>I want you to watch what I, or Sinbad, do.</i>

22:03.880 --> 22:07.300
<i>Then, judge whether I'm an enemy or ally.</i>

22:10.350 --> 22:12.970
<i>I want to believe Chiaki...</i>

22:14.020 --> 22:15.230
<i>Because...</i>

22:15.230 --> 22:18.190
<i>...I love him so much!</i>

22:28.610 --> 22:35.250
The thick clouds past and the descending light...

22:36.000 --> 22:44.670
...slowly melts the hardened, damaged past.

22:45.260 --> 22:49.130
Because we live so stiffly,

22:49.130 --> 22:52.850
it's so easy to smash into pieces.

22:53.050 --> 23:01.980
And I never thought that I had anything to protect...

23:02.520 --> 23:05.690
Never forgetting...

23:05.980 --> 23:09.820
...there is unending love.

23:10.530 --> 23:14.580
I'll catch it, I'll steal it.

23:14.780 --> 23:17.870
Then embrace you with it.

23:18.160 --> 23:21.080
Even if there comes a time...

23:21.580 --> 23:26.050
...when this planet is destroyed,

23:26.250 --> 23:30.090
I won't be lonely, I won't be alone.

23:30.340 --> 23:37.890
I'll be embracing an eternal wind.

23:47.940 --> 23:54.120
Jeanne, I know it's against the rules for a policeman's daughter to ask for this, but...

23:54.120 --> 23:59.250
But please! Onii-chan.. Please save my Onii-chan!

23:59.250 --> 24:01.000
<i>To Toudaiji Miyako-sama:</i>

24:01.000 --> 24:03.880
<i>Tonight, I will steal the beauty of your wish.</i>

24:03.880 --> 24:05.880
What?! Jeanne...?!

24:05.880 --> 24:09.300
Kamikaze Kaitou Jeanne: Is a Thief an Ally of a Cop?!

24:10.090 --> 24:14.140
Miyako, it's all right. You've asked me this favor, so I won't let you down!
